el Xeon Silver 4314 (16核/32緒, 2.4GHz)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;記憶體 RAM:&lt;/b&gt; 64GB ECC DDR4-3200 (4x 16GB)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;本機儲存 Storage:&lt;/b&gt; 2x 960GB NVMe SSD (RAID 1 OS) + 2x 2.4TB SAS 10K (RAID 1 本地離線暫存庫)&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;網卡 NIC:&lt;/b&gt; 2x 10GbE SFP+ + 4x 1GbE RJ45 &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;帶外管理 OOB:&lt;/b&gt; iDRAC9 Enterprise (Dedicated Port, 172.16.20.100)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="15" y="94" width="1330" height="76" as_="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="529" parent="482" value="«executionEnvironment» K3s Edge Kubernetes Cluster on Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (輕量容器邊緣架構) | Host IP: 172.16.20.10" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#132035;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#60a5fa;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;startSize=24;swimlaneFillColor=#0b1526;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="15" y="178" width="1330" height="250" as_="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="530" parent="529" value="«pod» RDG-SEW-EDGE (車縫產線邊緣節點) (172.16.20.11)" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#f8fafc;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;startSize=22;swimlaneFillColor=#062820;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="10" y="28" width="650" height="216" as_="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="531" parent="530" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10px; color:#e2e8f0; line-height:1.45; text-align:left;'&gt;&lt;b style='color:#fcd34d;'&gt;規格:&lt;/b&gt; 8 vCPU / 24GB RAM&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b style='color:#38bdf8;'&gt;作業系統:&lt;/b&gt; Alpine Linux Container&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='height:4px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style='color:#4ade80;'&gt;【核心服務與對應 Port 矩陣】&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;span style='color:#67e8f9; font-weight:bold;'&gt;TCP 1883:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='color:#ffffff;