 Gbps AWS Enhanced Networking (ENA) &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;帶外管理 OOB:&lt;/b&gt; AWS Nitro System Security Enclave / AWS Systems Manager (SSM)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="15" y="94" width="2490" height="76" as_="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="589" parent="542" value="«executionEnvironment» AWS Nitro Hypervisor (Containerd / Docker 24.0 on Amazon Linux 2023) | Host IP: 10.200.1.50" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#132035;strokeColor=#2563eb;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#60a5fa;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;startSize=24;swimlaneFillColor=#0b1526;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="15" y="178" width="2490" height="190" as_="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="590" parent="589" value="«pod» AI 視覺打樣辨識推論容器 (AI Vision Sampling Engine) (10.200.1.51)" style="swimlane;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;fillColor=#064e3b;strokeColor=#10b981;strokeWidth=1.5;rounded=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#f8fafc;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;startSize=22;swimlaneFillColor=#062820;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="10" y="28" width="1230" height="156" as_="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="591" parent="590" value="&lt;div style='font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:10px; color:#e2e8f0; line-height:1.45; text-align:left;'&gt;&lt;b style='color:#fcd34d;'&gt;規格:&lt;/b&gt; NVIDIA A10G Tensor Core GPU / 2 vCPU / 8GB RAM&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b style='color:#38bdf8;'&gt;作業系統:&lt;/b&gt; PyTorch 2.1 + CUDA 12.1 + NVIDIA A10G (24GB VRAM)&lt;br/&gt;&lt;div style='height:4px;'&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;b style='color:#4ade80;'&gt;【核心服務與對應 Port 矩陣】&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;span style='color:#67e8f9; font-weight:bold;'&gt;TCP 8000:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='color:#ffffff; font-weight:bold;'&gt;FastAPI AI 視覺特徵比對服務&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style='color:#94a3b8; font-size:9px;'&gt;(樣品成衣車縫線瑕疵與紋理匹配推論)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;s